            <ArticleTitle>Efficacy of marker wire for intracoronary stenting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>447-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Marker Wire was used for Palmaz-Schatz coronary stent implantation. The Marker Wire is useful in estimating lesion length and in determining the number of stents required, in addition to facilitating stent positioning.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
